/* The atlas's modern look: the window frame left of the modern minimap, its
   top right 160dp from the screen's right edge and 12dp from the top, the
   map image (the view at the atlas image's size, 256dp for most maps) in a
   padded body, the title in the title row. The window's width and height
   follow the view's: RmlUi counts an inline-level replaced box in a
   window's shrink-to-fit width, and not a block-level one, so the view is
   an inline-block on the line's top. Classic (the stone board with the legacy title bar,
   the view at 7, 30, the frame 15dp wider and 38dp taller than the image,
   its left edge 402dp left of the screen's right edge):
   skins/classic/windows/atlas.rcss. */

body.atlas
{
	left: auto;
	right: 160dp;
	top: 12dp;
	focus: none;
	tab-index: none;
}
.atlas button
{
	tab-index: none;
	focus: none;
}
.atlas__body
{
	display: block;
	padding: var(--space-2);
}
.atlas__view
{
	display: inline-block;
	vertical-align: top;
}
/* The hint opens left of the close button, inside the window. */
.atlas__tip
{
	left: auto;
	right: 100%;
	bottom: auto;
	top: 0;
	margin-bottom: 0;
	margin-right: var(--space-1);
	margin-left: -320dp;
}
